WEBVTT

01:49.484 --> 01:51.277
From this day forward...

01:52.737 --> 01:54.197
I have no use for my fangs.

01:56.491 --> 01:58.284
This grants me the right

01:58.868 --> 02:01.246
to punch you in the face!

02:11.131 --> 02:13.508
I was wondering
what your punch would feel like.

02:14.092 --> 02:16.302
Even weaker than I thought.

02:16.845 --> 02:20.473
It represents your personality.

02:23.059 --> 02:25.353
<i>Removing his fangs
didn't weaken him one bit.</i>

02:25.854 --> 02:28.106
<i>Quite the opposite.</i>

02:28.189 --> 02:30.066
<i>All of a sudden,</i>

02:30.150 --> 02:35.155
<i>he's taken on the aura of an apex predator
who reigns at the top of the food chain.</i>

02:40.910 --> 02:42.954
My staff will be coming to check on me.

02:45.331 --> 02:48.376
Even carnivores have a sense of reason.

02:49.002 --> 02:50.712
We suffer too.

02:51.880 --> 02:53.923
What you're doing is wrong.

02:54.549 --> 02:56.843
I hit you so you'd get the picture,

02:58.636 --> 03:02.682
but I apologize
for disrespecting a Beastar.

03:04.017 --> 03:05.685
I'll be leaving now.

03:08.313 --> 03:10.356
<i>Mr. Yahya! The fire alarm is going off!</i>

03:12.567 --> 03:14.736
I just knocked over a candle.

03:18.823 --> 03:23.202
<i>I think I like you after all, Legoshi.</i>

03:25.204 --> 03:30.126
THE GUY BORN IN SPRING

03:32.795 --> 03:34.464
Follow my finger.

03:36.257 --> 03:37.258
Look.

03:38.384 --> 03:39.385
No?

03:40.220 --> 03:41.638
Can you hear my voice?

03:48.478 --> 03:50.730
I'm not seeing any Kines symptoms.

03:56.486 --> 03:57.487
Okay, now.

03:59.155 --> 04:00.949
Relax. I'm a doctor.

04:01.574 --> 04:04.160
Though I am known
for my rough-and-tumble methods.

04:06.079 --> 04:08.081
Let's try to get along, eh?

04:12.085 --> 04:13.086
Hey, Legoshi.

04:13.711 --> 04:15.463
Mr. Gohin.

04:16.047 --> 04:18.967
Shush. Keep your mouth shut
for a few days.

04:25.348 --> 04:26.933
Don't touch it, either.

04:29.560 --> 04:30.395
Hey!

04:31.437 --> 04:34.649
I'm not going to show mercy
just because you're a female.

04:34.732 --> 04:35.858
Got it?

04:35.942 --> 04:37.777
Don't try anything funny.

04:41.906 --> 04:42.907
Jeez.

04:47.704 --> 04:50.164
Sorry, we're out of beds.

04:55.586 --> 04:57.005
WHAT DID THAT FOX DO?

04:57.088 --> 04:59.007
She devoured a rabbit.

05:03.011 --> 05:07.348
You gave me quite the shock,
showing up here and passing out.

05:08.891 --> 05:10.018
Who did that to you?

05:14.981 --> 05:16.691
I PULLED MY FANGS OUT
AND PUNCHED MR. YAHYA

05:16.774 --> 05:17.650
Yahya?

05:18.151 --> 05:21.070
You got in a fight with Yahya?

05:23.281 --> 05:25.033
I'LL WRITE UP A DETAILED REPORT

05:25.116 --> 05:27.410
Like I'd read it, dumbass.

05:28.161 --> 05:30.955
I'm busy dealing with Kines patients.

05:33.207 --> 05:34.959
KINES IS A MEAT NARCOTIC!

05:37.003 --> 05:38.004
Are you sure?

05:40.089 --> 05:43.092
I'LL WRITE UP A DETAILED REPORT

05:43.176 --> 05:44.177
Forget it.

05:44.802 --> 05:47.638
Rest here until the swelling goes down.

05:54.520 --> 05:56.898
GIANT PANDA

06:04.822 --> 06:05.823
Good morning.

06:14.665 --> 06:17.376
There are two kinds of devourers.

06:18.628 --> 06:23.633
Those who crave more meat,
and those who feel shame and avoid it.

06:24.342 --> 06:27.011
There are different treatments for each.

06:32.517 --> 06:37.730
Last night, you ate a live rabbit
in an alley off Center Street.

06:38.481 --> 06:39.816
Were they an acquaintance?

06:44.612 --> 06:45.613
Doctor.

06:48.241 --> 06:50.952
I'll let you sleep with me.

06:53.121 --> 06:54.372
Doctor, please.

06:55.039 --> 06:56.958
Come on, take me!

06:57.041 --> 06:59.919
- Are you afraid of the truth?
- Come on, I said!

07:02.296 --> 07:05.341
Doctor! Take me!

07:05.424 --> 07:06.926
Please!

07:07.677 --> 07:10.638
Please! I'm begging you!

07:10.721 --> 07:14.767
- Just do it! Why?
- Hey, listen to me!

07:15.351 --> 07:19.021
Even if I slept with you,
it wouldn't solve your problems.

07:20.356 --> 07:23.901
If you don't find out
what drove you to your actions,

07:24.402 --> 07:26.821
your heart will never heal.

07:28.489 --> 07:30.032
My heart?

07:31.075 --> 07:32.076
Heal?

07:32.785 --> 07:33.786
That's right.

07:35.413 --> 07:39.876
First, you have to
accept what you've done.

07:40.460 --> 07:42.253
No matter how hard it may be.

07:46.466 --> 07:48.092
Tell me about yourself.

07:49.677 --> 07:51.137
Myself...

07:52.221 --> 07:53.264
I'll listen.

07:59.729 --> 08:03.065
Yahya told you to apologize
for eating meat?

08:04.025 --> 08:07.445
He's getting even more stubborn with age.

08:08.571 --> 08:10.740
He had a partner in his younger days.

08:10.823 --> 08:14.410
They were like yin and yang.
They balanced each other out.

08:17.622 --> 08:19.207
His partner did have his own issues.

08:19.290 --> 08:21.584
He was some kind of venomous lizard.

08:23.002 --> 08:25.922
Was it Go... hin? No, that's me.

08:26.506 --> 08:29.008
I think it was Gosha.

08:29.509 --> 08:30.384
<i>What?</i>

08:30.468 --> 08:31.469
<i>Grandpa?</i>

08:32.803 --> 08:33.638
What is it?

08:33.721 --> 08:35.556
<i>I see.</i>

08:36.599 --> 08:38.184
<i>That explains why he was so strong.</i>

08:39.185 --> 08:41.187
Rumor has it they had a falling out.

08:41.687 --> 08:44.607
Things might be different
if he were around.

08:46.776 --> 08:50.655
<i>What happened
between Grandpa and Mr. Yahya?</i>

08:59.080 --> 09:01.290
We've found the location
in the photograph.

09:01.791 --> 09:03.543
A multi-tenant building on Center Street.

09:04.043 --> 09:05.503
Did you find ivory?

09:06.212 --> 09:09.507
No, but there was something strange.

09:10.675 --> 09:14.345
If we overlap
the blueprints for each floor...

09:15.096 --> 09:18.808
Let's see. Yes, here.

09:19.433 --> 09:23.521
There's a space with no windows or doors
going from the top floor to the basement.

09:26.649 --> 09:29.110
The herbivore counseling room
on the fifth floor.

09:30.570 --> 09:32.822
That's one big sofa.

09:34.657 --> 09:36.158
Zoom in on the fireplace.

09:37.368 --> 09:38.369
Close in on the floor.

09:41.664 --> 09:43.207
The fireplace again.

09:45.251 --> 09:46.419
I see.

09:47.211 --> 09:48.462
Who's that on the right?

09:49.714 --> 09:51.132
This is the counselor.

09:51.841 --> 09:53.676
A gazelle?

09:55.136 --> 09:58.472
Seeing a fellow herbivore,
the elephants would drop their guards.

09:58.556 --> 10:02.727
Then they'd be killed,
pushed down the fireplace,

10:02.810 --> 10:04.478
and dismembered in the basement.

10:05.396 --> 10:08.566
And finally,
they'd have their valuable tusks removed.

10:08.649 --> 10:09.984
It checks out.

10:11.110 --> 10:13.487
Right in the middle of downtown?

10:17.325 --> 10:20.786
<i>Is this... a challenge?</i>

10:26.667 --> 10:29.211
This looks great.

10:29.920 --> 10:31.422
I'm a set designer, after all.

10:32.131 --> 10:34.216
Thanks for the help.

10:35.009 --> 10:36.385
Especially that Kines report.

10:37.053 --> 10:41.849
Don't worry about it.
Sorry for staying here all week.

10:43.684 --> 10:45.102
Legoshi, here.

10:47.605 --> 10:50.733
These will help you talk and eat.

10:53.152 --> 10:54.445
No thanks.

10:55.529 --> 10:59.492
I knew what I was doing
when I pulled out my fangs.

11:00.284 --> 11:01.535
I don't need them.

11:02.078 --> 11:03.788
How will you eat?

11:03.871 --> 11:05.373
I'll eat porridge forever.

11:05.915 --> 11:07.667
The ladies won't like it.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.377
I'll be a virgin forever anyway.

11:15.633 --> 11:19.637
Legoshi. I won't force you,
but at least try them on.

11:22.431 --> 11:23.432
Legoshi!

11:24.308 --> 11:26.852
If you insist.

11:38.906 --> 11:39.907
So?

11:41.158 --> 11:42.743
I do feel better.

11:46.205 --> 11:50.668
I trained with you because
I wanted to be strong without my fangs.

11:52.837 --> 11:54.088
But in the end,

11:54.171 --> 11:58.467
you ate your friend's leg
to win a fight against a bear.

11:59.468 --> 12:02.805
You've made it this far.
Be true to yourself as a wolf.

12:03.305 --> 12:07.435
After meeting with
the force of nature that is Mr. Yahya,

12:07.935 --> 12:11.313
the first place I went to
was the Black Market.

12:12.648 --> 12:16.694
<i>It's like I subconsciously
see it as my refuge.</i>

12:17.570 --> 12:19.280
<i>Doesn't that make me a hypocrite?</i>

12:20.990 --> 12:22.950
If that's what you think,

12:23.033 --> 12:25.202
you'll have to find
your own answer to that.

12:26.579 --> 12:27.580
Right.

12:28.122 --> 12:29.373
Thank you.

12:39.425 --> 12:43.471
You Tibetan sand foxes
really don't show your emotions.

12:44.054 --> 12:45.556
It was hard to tell with you.

12:47.224 --> 12:51.145
Between fighting with you
and receiving your care,

12:51.979 --> 12:54.899
I realized I was slowly
regaining my emotions back.

12:55.900 --> 12:58.068
You did well, Ai.

13:00.279 --> 13:02.615
The more time I spend with you,

13:02.698 --> 13:05.075
the guiltier I feel. I can't stand it.

13:05.659 --> 13:08.787
You won't devour again.

13:10.498 --> 13:11.499
Doctor.

13:13.918 --> 13:14.919
I...

13:16.337 --> 13:17.796
I'm going to turn myself in.

13:29.099 --> 13:29.975
Come on, now.

13:31.560 --> 13:34.021
I'd rather see you smile.

13:34.813 --> 13:36.899
You're the one who should smile.

13:36.982 --> 13:40.152
You said turning themselves in
is the best option for your patients.

13:40.236 --> 13:42.821
Well, best for society.

13:44.073 --> 13:48.077
I can be sad sometimes, you know.

13:48.869 --> 13:52.206
I'll leave my smile with you, then.

13:53.249 --> 13:56.460
You'll have to wait
until I'm released to see it.

13:57.002 --> 14:00.256
Can you do that for me?

14:02.174 --> 14:05.219
It better be a damn good smile.

14:07.846 --> 14:09.098
Come back soon.

14:11.559 --> 14:17.439
PLANT PRODUCTION RESEARCH FACILITY

14:18.232 --> 14:21.068
Look at all this equipment!

14:21.151 --> 14:23.946
You sure love plants, Haru.

14:24.029 --> 14:25.281
Don't you, Lisa?

14:25.865 --> 14:28.868
I heard going here
would land me a good job.

14:28.951 --> 14:30.619
That's not why you're here?

14:30.703 --> 14:32.997
I want to open a restaurant.

14:33.080 --> 14:34.039
Really?

14:34.123 --> 14:37.877
I want to serve vegetarian meals
that even carnivores can enjoy.

14:38.669 --> 14:39.503
What?

14:39.587 --> 14:43.007
That way everyone
can enjoy eating together.

14:43.549 --> 14:46.135
So I want to learn how to do that.

14:46.635 --> 14:49.430
You're an odd one, Haru.

14:54.894 --> 14:56.562
Attention, new students.

14:56.645 --> 15:00.232
Welcome to your first day
of Edible Plants and the Palate.

15:03.903 --> 15:06.655
You're all herbivores, right? Great.

15:07.156 --> 15:09.283
We don't have to worry about
the smell of beasts

15:09.366 --> 15:11.493
rubbing off on these beautiful plants.

15:14.705 --> 15:20.002
We herbivores have a palate
far more refined than that of carnivores.

15:20.085 --> 15:24.048
We are able to experience tastes
they cannot begin to fathom.

15:24.131 --> 15:26.717
Due to their barbaric and violent nature,
of course.

15:28.510 --> 15:30.346
Isn't that discrimination?

15:31.555 --> 15:34.767
My boyfriend said it hurts his feelings
when people talk like that.

15:34.850 --> 15:37.853
Do you think that kind of speech
is appropriate for school?

15:37.937 --> 15:41.982
Yes, you're right. Forgive me.

15:43.025 --> 15:44.443
You're dating a carnivore?

15:44.526 --> 15:48.656
You've got to try it!
It'll totally change your values.

15:48.739 --> 15:51.367
All right, let us begin class.

15:55.454 --> 15:59.041
You're awesome, Ako! That was so cool.

15:59.124 --> 16:00.960
What happened?

16:01.460 --> 16:05.506
I just told our teacher
that his old way of thinking sucks.

16:05.589 --> 16:08.842
A lot of people say carnivores
and herbivores shouldn't date,

16:08.926 --> 16:12.888
but when you really understand each other
like we do, there's no problem!

16:12.972 --> 16:14.848
You shouldn't say that so lightly.

16:17.476 --> 16:21.772
If mutual understanding is all it takes
for carnivores and herbivores to date,

16:21.855 --> 16:24.733
I don't think we'd see
so many devouring incidents.

16:25.693 --> 16:30.614
You know your heart
can never beat out your instincts, right?

16:31.907 --> 16:36.578
Can you really love him
knowing his body will always crave meat?

16:37.871 --> 16:39.748
I hate to say it,

16:39.832 --> 16:44.169
but you guys are only dating
because it's trendy, aren't you?

16:48.590 --> 16:52.344
Wait up. Don't be mad at <i>me.</i>

16:52.428 --> 16:54.221
Why aren't <i>you</i> mad?

16:54.304 --> 16:56.724
You could've at least said something.

16:56.807 --> 16:58.434
She made a fool of me.

16:58.517 --> 17:00.019
It didn't really bother me...

17:00.728 --> 17:03.355
You're just mad because she's right.

17:03.439 --> 17:05.274
About us dating because it's trendy.

17:06.442 --> 17:08.861
Honestly, we're just having some fun,
aren't we?

17:08.944 --> 17:11.196
There's no need to get so worked up.

17:12.072 --> 17:13.073
Eado.

17:14.700 --> 17:16.869
Turns out you're just
an ordinary lion, huh?

17:18.037 --> 17:21.165
You're running away
because you can't see a rabbit as a woman?

17:21.665 --> 17:24.918
If I'm wrong, then kiss me! Right here!

17:28.505 --> 17:29.840
Fine.

17:42.186 --> 17:43.771
That wasn't so hard, was it?

17:43.854 --> 17:46.982
I can't let you get away with
calling me an ordinary lion.

18:12.007 --> 18:15.761
<i>The furnishings here
are sized to fit elephants.</i>

18:16.929 --> 18:20.390
<i>It's great to talk to an herbivore doctor.</i>

18:22.101 --> 18:28.065
<i>No matter how big and scary we look,
we're still herbivores.</i>

18:28.148 --> 18:29.691
<i>So...</i>

18:31.527 --> 18:35.239
<i>Don't worry. Let it all out.</i>

18:45.124 --> 18:50.254
<i>I'm sorry, Doctor.
I wasn't planning on crying.</i>

18:57.219 --> 19:01.473
Oh, a new patient.
Did you make an appointment?

19:02.057 --> 19:04.977
I'll need you to leave
your valuables at the front desk.

19:05.060 --> 19:06.937
I've seen who you really are.

19:07.020 --> 19:12.693
I'm honored to be recognized by a Beastar.

19:15.696 --> 19:16.864
You...

19:17.656 --> 19:19.283
I thought you recognized me?

19:20.075 --> 19:21.869
My name is Melon.

19:22.536 --> 19:24.163
Don't forget it.

19:29.084 --> 19:32.045
Just when we were
getting to know each other.

19:32.671 --> 19:35.632
Sorry you won't make it to the party.

19:37.593 --> 19:38.677
Wait!

19:49.605 --> 19:53.942
<i>I shouldn't have said all that.
Not that any of it was wrong.</i>

19:54.693 --> 19:58.197
<i>Who talks about their friends like that?
I'm the worst.</i>

19:59.781 --> 20:02.492
<i>Maybe I'm just jealous.</i>

20:03.118 --> 20:05.204
<i>Seeing an interspecies couple having fun.</i>

20:06.496 --> 20:08.373
<i>I'll apologize to Ako.</i>

20:08.457 --> 20:09.625
Seriously?

20:10.125 --> 20:11.251
It looks bad.

20:13.837 --> 20:15.672
- Ako!
- Stay back!

20:17.382 --> 20:19.927
I... I lost control.

20:24.056 --> 20:25.057
I...

20:25.724 --> 20:26.850
I...

20:29.937 --> 20:31.688
She told me to kiss her, so I did.

20:32.439 --> 20:35.901
I wasn't trying to eat her, but...

20:35.984 --> 20:37.361
What have I done?

20:40.781 --> 20:43.075
Please! Save her!

20:43.158 --> 20:45.327
- Get in the car!
- Ako!

20:45.410 --> 20:46.662
Shut up!

20:46.745 --> 20:48.372
- Get in the car, already!
- Ako!

20:49.665 --> 20:51.959
<i>The ground is covered in blood.</i>

20:53.502 --> 20:55.837
<i>But the weather is so beautiful.</i>

21:01.343 --> 21:02.344
You'll get wet.

21:03.428 --> 21:06.348
It's hard to get it out
once it's been sitting for a while.

21:08.934 --> 21:13.480
<i>Can you really love him
knowing his body will always crave meat?</i>

21:16.733 --> 21:18.068
<i>I knew it from the start.</i>

21:21.196 --> 21:23.407
<i>Being in love with a carnivore</i>

21:24.324 --> 21:27.202
<i>brings nothing but pain and misery.</i>

21:28.328 --> 21:31.206
<i>It's not all fun and smiles.</i>

21:33.041 --> 21:35.335
<i>But... that's...</i>

21:36.545 --> 21:37.879
<i>That's exactly why I...</i>

21:47.639 --> 21:50.559
UDON BEBEBE

21:50.642 --> 21:53.186
<i>- At around 3:00 this afternoon...</i>
- Thanks for waiting.

21:53.270 --> 21:56.189
<i>...a devouring incident
occurred at Algama University.</i>

21:56.773 --> 21:58.650
<i>That's the college Haru goes to.</i>

22:04.573 --> 22:06.700
Happy birthday, Legoshi!

22:07.909 --> 22:11.038
I wanted to tell you in person, so...
I came here.

23:36.915 --> 23:41.920
Subtitle translation by: Thomas Grathwol
